{"parse":{"title":"铃兰之剑：九月日历","pageid":3101,"revid":6644,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E9%93%83%E5%85%B0%E4%B9%8B%E5%89%91%EF%BC%9A%E4%B9%9D%E6%9C%88%E6%97%A5%E5%8E%86&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E9%93%83%E5%85%B0%E4%B9%8B%E5%89%91%EF%BC%9A%E4%B9%9D%E6%9C%88%E6%97%A5%E5%8E%86&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E9%93%83%E5%85%B0%E4%B9%8B%E5%89%91%EF%BC%9A%E4%B9%9D%E6%9C%88%E6%97%A5%E5%8E%86&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF\" title=\"官方消息\">官方消息</a>&gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E4%B8%93%E9%A2%98\" title=\"专题\">专题</a> &gt; <b>铃兰之剑：九月日历</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h1><span id=\".E9.93.83.E5.85.B0.E4.B9.8B.E5.89.91.7C.E4.B9.9D.E6.9C.88.E6.97.A5.E5.8E.86\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"铃兰之剑|九月日历\">铃兰之剑|九月日历</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E9%93%83%E5%85%B0%E4%B9%8B%E5%89%91%EF%BC%9A%E4%B9%9D%E6%9C%88%E6%97%A5%E5%8E%86&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"编辑章节：铃兰之剑|九月日历\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h1>\n<div class=\"sidebar-card\" style=\"margin:15px 0px\"><b>本文来自</b>：官方微信公众号<br /><b>原作者</b>：开预约的小场记<br /><b>发布时间</b>：2023-08-30 16:51<br /><b>原视频/文章地址</b>：<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"http://game.bilibili.com/linkfilter/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmp.weixin.qq.com%2Fs%2FUPfnpeg6Zbbz-lo55uZpLQ\" target=\"_blank\">https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/UPfnpeg6Zbbz-lo55uZpLQ</a></div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-6\" style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\n<p><br />\n<img alt=\"官方消息184.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/6/6e/q9iptbgovnwblr748eld1vf45r5gung.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"750\" height=\"200\" data-file-width=\"750\" data-file-height=\"200\" />\n<br /><br />\n</p>\n<center>\n<p>团长团长！<font color=\"purple\"><b>贝拉</b></font>发现一个秘密！<br />\n小猫睡觉时发出的<font color=\"purple\"><b>呼噜呼噜</b></font>声<br />\n和咱做研究时<br />\n药水<font color=\"purple\"><b>咕噜咕噜</b></font>的声音很像呢！<br />\n<img alt=\"官方消息185.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/a/a3/a68kboxhbtqzto9hp0xwnzset9luz8n.png/150px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF185.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"152\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/a/a3/a68kboxhbtqzto9hp0xwnzset9luz8n.png/225px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF185.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/a/a3/a68kboxhbtqzto9hp0xwnzset9luz8n.png/300px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF185.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"425\" data-file-height=\"431\" /><br /><br />\n相信非常多团长，在期待的同时<br />\n也对游戏抱有着诸多疑问\n<br /><br />\n听说对着<font color=\"purple\"><b>小猫胡须</b></font>许愿可以成真<br />\n那就希望团长<font color=\"purple\"><b>早点回家</b></font>吧~<br />\n给团长们带来<font color=\"purple\"><b>9月</b></font>的壁纸<br />\n不在家的时间里，也千万千万不能忘了咱~\n<br /><br />\n<img alt=\"官方消息186.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/0/0d/7xbp1f5gn04ko7s3sl9y8vkljovftmk.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1080\" height=\"1920\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1920\" />\n<br /><br />\n<img alt=\"官方消息187.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/9/92/nmaqcv4hb6cuu83hl3fqgxcqla33kpk.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1080\" height=\"608\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"608\" />\n<br />\n</p>\n</center>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261022163728\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\n[SMW] In‐text annotation parser time: 0 seconds\nCPU time usage: 0.028 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.059 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 94/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2014/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 274/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/40\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   33.763      1 -total\n 53.48%   18.055      1 模板:文章戳\n 46.17%   15.589      1 模板:面包屑\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key gamecenter_wiki_llzj-pre_:pcache:idhash:3101-0!dateformat=default and timestamp 20261022163728 and revision id 6644. Serialized with PHP.\n -->\n</div>","categories":[{"sortkey":"","category":"专题"}],"images":["官方消息184.png","官方消息185.png","官方消息186.png","官方消息187.png"],"sections":[{"toclevel":1,"level":"1","line":"铃兰之剑|九月日历","number":"1","index":"1","fromtitle":"铃兰之剑：九月日历","byteoffset":16,"anchor":"铃兰之剑|九月日历"}],"displaytitle":"铃兰之剑：九月日历","wikitext":"{{面包屑|官方消息|专题}}\n=铃兰之剑|九月日历=\n{{文章戳\n|文章上级页面=专题\n|时间=2023-08-30 16:51\n|作者=开预约的小场记\n|是否原创=否\n|来源=官方微信公众号\n|原文地址=https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/UPfnpeg6Zbbz-lo55uZpLQ\n}}\n\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-6\" style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\n<br>\n[[File:官方消息184.png|link=]]\n<br><br>\n<center>\n团长团长！<font color=purple>'''贝拉'''</font>发现一个秘密！<br>\n小猫睡觉时发出的<font color=purple>'''呼噜呼噜'''</font>声<br>\n和咱做研究时<br>\n药水<font color=purple>'''咕噜咕噜'''</font>的声音很像呢！<br>\n[[File:官方消息185.png|150px|link=]]<br><br>\n相信非常多团长，在期待的同时<br>\n也对游戏抱有着诸多疑问\n<br><br>\n听说对着<font color=purple>'''小猫胡须'''</font>许愿可以成真<br>\n那就希望团长<font color=purple>'''早点回家'''</font>吧~<br>\n给团长们带来<font color=purple>'''9月'''</font>的壁纸<br>\n不在家的时间里，也千万千万不能忘了咱~\n<br><br>\n[[File:官方消息186.png|link=]]\n<br><br>\n[[File:官方消息187.png|link=]]\n<br>\n</center>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n</div>"},"capturedAt":"2026-10-22T16:37:29.193556+00:00"}